GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "EEAA878816D37D11"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{0CFCE891B0E8CB9A}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "<h2>OVERVIEW</h2>"\
     "Angry coal miners are sick of having their wages cut while their working hours increase. Management couldn't care less, so the workers have picked up arms and killed everyone in the complex who isn't one of their fellow blue-collar workers."\
     ""\
     "Can Russian SOBR restore order? "\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
     "• 10sec setup timer. <b>The mission goes live as soon as you pass the setup.</b>"\
     "FIA spawn at the top of the coal refinery, with Russian forces on the ground below. You're only 25 metres apart in a straight line, but staircases, walls and multiple levels stand between you. There is no direct line of sight between spawns, but don't mistake that for safety. Both teams can start pushing immediately, and you may find the enemy at your doorstep sooner than expected."\
     ""\
     "Waste time, blame yourself."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3999CAFD29AA34B5}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     ""\
     "DTL: 14/10/2018, 0715hr, Gorshkovo, Cain."\
     ""\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "For years, the workers at the coal refinery have been expected to work longer hours for wages that have barely kept pace. Attempts to negotiate better conditions, organise through unions and take action through protests have achieved little. Management has remained unmoved, and the workforce has had enough."\
     ""\
     "What began as a dispute over pay and working hours has now turned violent. Armed workers have seized weapons and equipment, turning on management and killing those within the complex who weren't part of the workforce. The refinery is now in the hands of the very people who keep it running."\
     ""\
     "With the situation beyond the control of the site's ordinary security, Russian SOBR forces have been deployed to restore order. The workers have made their move; now the refinery is about to become a battleground."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{43B5E792FCEAFA58}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     ""\
     "DTL: 14/10/2018, 0715hr, Gorshkovo, Cain."\
     ""\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "For years, the workers at the coal refinery have been expected to work longer hours for wages that have barely kept pace. Attempts to negotiate better conditions, organise through unions and take action through protests have achieved little. Management has remained unmoved, and the workforce has had enough."\
     ""\
     "What began as a dispute over pay and working hours has now turned violent. Armed workers have seized weapons and equipment, turning on management and killing those within the complex who weren't part of the workforce. The refinery is now in the hands of the very people who keep it running."\
     ""\
     "With the situation beyond the control of the site's ordinary security, Russian SOBR forces have been deployed to restore order. The workers have made their move; now the refinery is about to become a battleground."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E777312D8931483D}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Reports indicate approximately seven armed workers remain in control of the coal refinery. The group consists of former refinery employees who have taken up arms. They are located on the top floor but have freedom of movement within the building."\
     "They could hold the top floor, push down the stairs and hold lower, or even counter attack into us if we take to long outside."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Armed with a variety of modern AK-pattern rifles,machine guns, including RPDs and PKMs, have reportedly been sighted."\
     "Some personnel may carry GP-25 under-barrel grenade launchers and anti-tank launchers."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "The group is believed to be operating with equipment seized or acquired prior to the takeover. Their ammunition reserves, available supplies and ability to sustain a prolonged defence are unknown."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6084A3E62EAC32A4}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Russian SOBR special forces have been deployed to retake the coal refinery. The detachment, identified as <b>Vityaz-7</b>, consists of approximately 24 personnel. They are positioned directly outside the building's only entrance and exit, on the ground floor."\
     ""\
     "The Russians must enter through this single doorway and fight their way up the staircases and through the refinery's various levels to reach us on the top floor. They could go fast and strike hard, or take it slow, time is theirs and we can't go anywhere now. Be prepared for them to storm the stairs if we don't defend it. Our choice."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• HIgh likelyhood of a marksmen/sniper being positioned in the hills."\
     "• Can take their time. We have no where to go."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "The extent of their support is unknown. Given their relatively small numbers and limited equipment, this may be a rapid-response team deployed to deal with the situation quickly."\
     ""\
     "Don't take too long to deal with the SOBR. If this drags on, further forces may arrive before we have a chance to get out."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{733D7398A9921615}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are a 24-man Russian SOBR special detachment, designated <b>Vityaz-7</b>."\
     "We begin outside the building, on the ground floor directly in front of its only entrance. Beyond the entrance, a large series of staircases leads upwards through roughly six floors. The structure consists of multiple levels with small rooms, leading to a large, open working gantry on the top floor, offering a 360-degree view of the surrounding outside area and a ladder access onto the exposed roof."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Our sharpshooter has been postioned in the hills to the north. He has total freedom of movement and can go where he wishes."\
     "(If he enters the AO limit around the building, he wont be able to leave)"\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No vehicle support."\
     "• No reinforcements."\
     "• No rearm or resupply during the operation."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{72159E4B364EBF2C}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are seven very angry coal miners occupying the Gorshkovo coal refinery. "\
     ""\
     "Our group occupies the <b>top floor</b> of the refinery, with freedom to move throughout the building. We can meet the enemy on the staircases as they fight their way up, hold our ground on the upper floors, or even launch a counterattack and push them back down and out of the building. The choice is ours."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Armed with a variety of modern AK-pattern rifles and machine guns, including RPDs and PKMs."\
     "• Some personnel equipped with GP-25 under-barrel grenade launchers and anti-tank launchers."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No reinforcements."\
     "• No rearm or resupply during the operation."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4DE2AD96D32CA1DF}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Clear the coal refinery of all armed miners in order to secure the complex."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Russian SOBR forces are to advance through the refinery, clear all floors and rooms, and eliminate the armed workers occupying the complex. All armed miners must be neutralised before the building can be considered secure."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{BA3EA2F7AE85BBCE}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Repel the Russian SOBR assault and inflict enough casualties to force their withdrawal from the refinery."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Russian SOBR forces are moving in to retake the coal refinery. Hold your ground, defend the building and eliminate enough of the assault force to make continuing the operation too costly."\
     ""\
     "You didn't come this far just to hand the place back. Make them regret coming through that door and give them everything you've got!"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FE1A8661E4B501EE}" {
     m_iOrder 9
